{
  "sourceLanguage" : "ja",
  "strings" : {
    "%@さんから招待が届いています" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ has sent you an invitation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@へようこそ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Welcome to %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lldpt" : {
      "comment" : "見本のメンバーがもらったポイント",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lldpt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10文字以内で入力してください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter up to 10 characters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appleでサインイン" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sign in with Apple"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appleアカウントで、すぐに始められます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Get started right away with your Apple Account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "homeauは無料のままでもすべての家事管理機能をお使いいただけます。\nもっと快適に使いたい方向けに、プレミアムプランをご用意しています。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every chore management feature in homeau is free to use.\nFor an even better experience, we also offer a Premium Plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "homeauへようこそ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Welcome to homeau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あと%lld文字" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld character left"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld characters left"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あとで決める" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maybe Later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あとで登録する" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add Later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ありがとう、助かったよ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thanks, that really helped!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ありがとうを送り合えます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Say Thanks to Each Other"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このAppleアカウントは、すでに%@で使われています" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Apple Account is already used with %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この名前はパートナーの画面でも表示されます。\n後からいつでも変更可能です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This name will also appear on your partner's screen.\nYou can change it anytime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すでにアカウントをお持ちの方" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I Already Have an Account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そのアカウントでログインしますか？ここまでに登録したニックネームとパートナーは引き継がれず、削除されます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Log in with that account? The nickname and partner you have set up so far will not carry over and will be deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "たろう" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Taro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめまして、ほめっとだよ！" : {
      "comment" : "マスコットのほめっとのあいさつ。くだけた口調",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hi there, I'm Homette!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめまして！" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nice to meet you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめる" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Get Started"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめると、[利用規約](https://stotic-dev.github.io/homete_iOS/terms.html)と[プライバシーポリシー](https://stotic-dev.github.io/homete_iOS/privacy.html)に同意したことになります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "By getting started, you agree to the [Terms of Use](https://stotic-dev.github.io/homete_iOS/terms.html) and [Privacy Policy](https://stotic-dev.github.io/homete_iOS/privacy.html)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はなこ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanako"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はなこさんが「お風呂掃除」を終えました" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanako finished “Clean Bathroom”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まずはあなたのニックネームを教えてください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "First, tell us your nickname"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "やった家事を、かんたんに記録できます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Log Your Chores in a Tap"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アカウント登録" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Create Account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キャンセル" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ダッシュボードのバナー広告が消え、家事の記録に集中できます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Banner ads are removed from the Dashboard, so you can focus on your chores."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パートナーから招待が届いています" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your partner has sent you an invitation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パートナーが家事を終えると通知が届きます。ひとこと添えて、ありがとうを伝えられます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You'll be notified when your partner finishes a chore. Say thanks with a short note."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パートナーが隣にいる" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "My Partner Is Nearby"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パートナーと家事を分け合えます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Share Chores with Your Partner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パートナーと家事を分け合って、おたがいのがんばりをほめ合えるアプリです" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Share chores with your partner and cheer each other on for every effort."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パートナーを登録すると、家事を分け合えます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add your partner to share the chores."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プランを見る" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "View Plans"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プランを購入するには、Appleでのサインインが必要です。機種変更しても、購入したプランを引き継げます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To purchase a plan, you need to sign in with Apple. Your plan will carry over even if you change phones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プレミアムプランのご案内" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Introducing Premium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プレミアム限定の新機能が増えても、追加の料金はかかりません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New Premium-only features come at no extra cost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ユーザー名" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Username"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ログインする" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Log In"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今後追加される機能もすべて使えます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Get every feature we add in the future"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日の家事" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Today's Chores"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今週の分担" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Week's Share"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例：たろう" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "e.g. Alex"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全%lldステップ中%lldステップ目" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Step %2$lld of %1$lld"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "全%1$lldステップ中%2$lldステップ目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全%lldページ中%lldページ目" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Page %2$lld of %1$lld"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "全%1$lldページ中%2$lldページ目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "家事のリストを共有すると、だれがやるか、もう終わったかがひと目で分かります" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Share your chore list to see at a glance who's on it and what's already done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "家事の記録を始めるには、Appleでのサインインが必要です。機種変更しても、家事の記録を引き継げます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To start tracking chores, you need to sign in with Apple. Your chore history will carry over even if you change phones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "届いた招待リンクから、パートナーのグループに参加できます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Join your partner's group from the invite link you received."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告が表示されません" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No ads"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "招待リンクが見つかりませんでした。届いた招待リンクをもう一度開いてください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We couldn't find an invite link. Please open the invite link you received again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "招待リンクは送れましたか？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Did you send the invite link?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "招待リンクを受け取った" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I Received an Invite Link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "招待リンクを送る" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Send an Invite Link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "掃除機がけ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vacuum"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "次へ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Next"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "洗濯" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Laundry"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登録" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Register"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "終わった家事を記録すると、だれがどれだけがんばったか、あとから振り返れます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Log finished chores to look back on how much effort everyone put in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "続行すると、[利用規約](https://stotic-dev.github.io/homete_iOS/terms.html)と[プライバシーポリシー](https://stotic-dev.github.io/homete_iOS/privacy.html)に同意したことになります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "By continuing, you agree to the [Terms of Use](https://stotic-dev.github.io/homete_iOS/terms.html) and [Privacy Policy](https://stotic-dev.github.io/homete_iOS/privacy.html)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "誰と使いますか？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Who will you use it with?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "近くにいるパートナーと、その場で登録できます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add a partner who's right next to you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送ったので次へ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I sent it, continue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送ったら、パートナーの参加を待たずに次へ進めます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once it's sent, you can continue without waiting for your partner to join."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "離れていても、リンクから参加してもらえます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your partner can join from the link, even if you're apart."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "食器洗い" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wash Dishes"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.1"
